# CloudHost247 + Dokploy Integration Development Task
#
# OBJECTIVE: Integrate Dokploy Community Edition as backend deployment engine
# PRESERVE: Existing WHMCS, customer dashboard, billing, branding
# NEW: Cloud Application Hosting section in dashboard
