# INFRASTRUCTURE ARCHITECTURE:
# CloudHost247 Website -> Customer Dashboard -> CloudHost247 Backend API
#                                        |
#                                        v
#                               Dokploy Integration Service
#                                        |
#                                        v
#                               Dokploy Management Server (Community Edition)
#                                        |
#                                        v
#                               Docker Deployment Infrastructure
#                                        |
#                                        v
#                               Customer Applications and Databases
#
# DOMAINS:
# - cloudhost247.com (Main website)
# - dokploy.cloudhost247.com (Private admin interface)
# - apps.cloudhost247.com (Application hosting)
#
# TESTING REQUIREMENTS:
# 1. Customer purchases hosting plan (WHMCS)
# 2. Payment verified
# 3. Resources provisioned via Dokploy
# 4. Customer logs in, creates application
# 5. Connects GitHub repository
# 6. Application deploys successfully
# 7. Custom domain connected, SSL issued
# 8. Database created
# 9. Logs viewed, monitoring active
# 10. Plan upgraded/downgraded
# 11. Subscription suspended/reactivated
# 12. Two customers isolated (no cross-access)
# 13. Limits enforced (no bypass)
# 14. API credentials never exposed
# 15. Failed provisioning no duplicates
# 16. Payment failures no activation
# 17. Backup restoration works
# 18. Server failure/recovery works
#
# COST: FREE Community Edition (only VPS/storage/bandwidth/maintenance)
